{"screen_name": "Rune_Salt", "file": "Rune_Salt", "name": "kashio🧂skeb受付中", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1671436333850701824/RvqcTl9U.jpg", "header_url": "", "description": "※絵垢 百合好きというかただのカプ厨\nBluesky https://bsky.app/prof\npixiv https://www.pixiv.net/users/6310206\nskeb http://skeb.jp/@Rune_Salt \nfanbox http://saltsur.fanbox.cc", "total_works": 87, "scraped_works": 30, "first_seen": "2025-09-27T00:57:36.052847", "last_updated": "2025-09-27T00:57:36.052847", "price_history": {"comic": [{"amount": 13000, "recorded_at": "2025-09-27T00:57:36.052847"}], "art": [{"amount": 13000, "recorded_at": "2025-09-27T00:57:36.052847"}]}, "current_prices": {"comic": 13000, "art": 13000}, "price_range": {"comic": {"min": 13000, "max": 13000}, "art": {"min": 13000, "max": 13000}}, "links": [{"label": "Website", "url": "https://bsky.app/prof", "name": ""}], "flags": {"from_archive": true}, "works": [{"path": "/@Rune_Salt/works/87", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/5d3309fa/uploads/origins/c4740299-a336-4f2d-adaf-42c7fb04df79?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2aac7505b091a1b86c4092eadc920d2c", "thumbnail_srcset": "", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "レンゾクです！\n今年も秋シーズン(9月〜11月末)がやってまいりました！\n去年同様に、秋手形作品をリクエストさせていただきます！\n\n内容は\n\n顔面に真っ赤な張り手形の付いた、ウマ娘のトウカイテイオーをお願いします！\n\n(両頬手形もお願いします)\n\n(秋なので秋を感じる背景等でお願いします)", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Rune_Salt/works/86", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/dc29aac7/uploads/origins/ab5717fe-e171-4649-b465-dd177681a095?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=d39008c4f672ae6c79306e983c1f88cb", "thumbnail_srcset": "", "genre": "comic", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Rune_Salt/works/85", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/fe99c351/uploads/origins/3acb0a86-0688-40c6-96e1-8d136c58c1eb?bg